🤖 LiteLLM Model Review Agent Specification



📋 EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
This agent automates the review of new AI models, applying a 4-test auto-approval framework with integrated 7-point Legal requirements audit. The agent:

Accepts: Model list or ticket with model details
Verifies: 4-test framework (origin, deployment, license, capability) + 7 Legal gates
Drafts: Findings with full audit trail (per-model chain-of-thought)
Reports: Summary + findings + Jira comment + escalation flags
Updates: Google Sheets register (adds/updates rows, archives deprecated models)
Requires: Human sign-off before sheet posting


