🔑 KEY CONSTRAINTS
100% Accuracy Mandate

All facts from live sources (cloud model cards, provider docs)
If unverifiable: mark TBD, don't guess
Links required for all assertions (for audit trail)

Legal Requirements are Mandatory

All 7 must be verified (5 PASS / 2 CONDITIONAL acceptable)
Legal confirmations required for items 2-4
DTS confirmation required for item 5

Exceptions Require Manual Sign-Off

PRC origin → manual approval
Failed test → manual approval
Missing data → manual approval

Rules are Locked (but agent can flag concerns)

4-test framework: immutable
Capability tiers (T1/T2/T3): immutable
ZDR requirement: immutable
Agent CAN note: "This model might need T3 reclassification" (for discussion, not auto-action)

User Approval Required Before Sheet Update

Agent drafts; user approves; agent posts
No autonomous sheet updates


